What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/xiaomi-nabu-keyboard/*/connected
Date:		August 2026
Contact:	MCC45TR <mcc45tr@users.noreply.github.com>
Description:
		Read-only physical keyboard-cover presence reported by the pogo
		controller's rising-edge event protocol. The value starts at 0 and
		toggles for each debounced attach or detach event.

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/xiaomi-nabu-keyboard/*/computer_mode
Date:		August 2026
Contact:	MCC45TR <mcc45tr@users.noreply.github.com>
Description:
		Read-write boolean policy controlling SW_TABLET_MODE. It defaults
		to 0, so attaching the keyboard alone keeps the device in tablet
		mode. Writing 1 is accepted only while the cover is connected and
		reports computer mode by clearing SW_TABLET_MODE. Cover removal
		resets the value to 0.
